hsk-studio-layout third-party notices

src/cjk.rs (CJK kinsoku and mojikumi composition, lane SMB-ID-CJK-KINSOKU-1) carries DATA read
from two W3C Working Group Notes; no code was copied:

- "Requirements for Japanese Text Layout" (JLREQ), https://www.w3.org/TR/jlreq/ : the character
  classes cl-01..cl-19 (Appendix A), the line-start and line-end prohibition rules behind the shipped
  hard_kinsoku / soft_kinsoku tables (section 3.1.7) and the punctuation width and spacing rules
  behind the Japanese mojikumi base sets (sections 3.1.4, 3.2.2, 3.8).
- "Requirements for Chinese Text Layout" (CLREQ), https://www.w3.org/TR/clreq/ : punctuation width
  behind simplified_chinese_default and traditional_chinese_default (section 3.1).

